earch for his real parents. With the help of his KATUSA (Korean Augmentation Troops to the United States Army) friend Shin (Kim In-Kwon), James is able to find and visit the nursery in Choon-chun where he had briefly stayed before being adopted abroad. There, he learns that his Korean name was ‘Gong Eun-Chul’. He then decides to appear on a national TV program to help find his birth parents…","rating":{"sources":[],"value":0,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":11191,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}